<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34247" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pāvōnīnus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to a peacock.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ova pavonina,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 3, 9, 10</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pulli,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col. 8,
					11</span></i>
			, 
			 13: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">muscaria,</span>”
				<i>fly-flaps made of peacocks' tails</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Mart.
					14, 67</span></i>
			
			<i>in lemm.</i>—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>colored like a
				peacock's tail</i>, <i>pavonine</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lectus pavoninus,</span>”
				<i>a couch of citron-wood</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Mart.
					14, 85</span></i>
			
			<i>in lemm.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ornatus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tert. adv. Val. 13</span></i>
			.</div>
